`split_whitespace` already collapses runs of spaces, tabs and newlines and skips leading/trailing whitespace. Empty input gives an empty `Vec`; asking for more than there are just returns everything. The `then_with` tiebreak keeps output deterministic, which matters if this feeds a snapshot test.

