The sort key is `count desc, word asc`, so equal counts come out alphabetically. `to_lowercase` is applied per lowercase-able character rather than per code point, so multi-char expansions survive. `or_insert(0)` counts in one lookup. Build with `cargo build --release` or `rustc -O main.rs`.

