To filter by total per customer, aggregate first:

SELECT customer_id, SUM(amount) AS total FROM orders GROUP BY customer_id HAVING SUM(amount) > 0;

Check: `WHERE amount > 0` removes non-positive rows before grouping; `HAVING SUM(amount) > 0` keeps groups whose total is positive. Correct.

